1. Project nature

Lynx is a public, source-available project designed to securely,
efficiently, and safely manage and supervise applications and services.

The project is developed with a community-driven, open, and transparent
philosophy and is not intended to be a commercial product.

Lynx may be used by individuals or organizations of any kind, provided
that the terms of this license are respected.


